      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "The §3Orbital Precision Laser§r is a solar-powered orbital weapon, a lighter alternative to the §3Orbital Death Ray§r. It fires an instantaneous beam dealing massive damage to entities within a 5-block radius, though its explosive yield is only roughly equivalent to a single block of TNT. Recharge time between shots is §e5 seconds§r.\n\nIt is controlled via §dRedstone-over-Radio§r through a §3Satellite Ground Station§r. When paired with targeting data from a §3Radar Survey Satellite§r it can shoot down missiles. The \"fire\" command fires at the current target coordinates, or at a tracked entity if one has been set - entity target data is consumed after a single shot. The \"canfire\" command writes TRUE or FALSE to RX depending on whether the laser has finished recharging. The \"setentitytarget\" command accepts an entity ID from a §3Radar Satellite§r for precision tracking.\n\n§2Entity target data is consumed after one shot, reverting back to coordinate targeting.",
